@page "/about"
@attribute [AllowAnonymous]

<PageTitle>About | Connect Four</PageTitle>

<div class="page-heading">
    <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT</p>
        <h1>Connect Four Match Tracker</h1>
        <p class="text-secondary">A .NET Blazor web application for casual players who want to play and keep a private match history.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<section class="page-card content-prose">
    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <p>
        Two players share one device and take turns dropping pieces into the board. The application detects wins and draws automatically.
        Signed-in users can save completed games, add match records manually, edit them, and delete them.
    </p>

    <h2>Privacy and accounts</h2>
    <p>
        Match history is separated by account. Passwords are never stored as plain text; the application uses ASP.NET Core's password hasher.
    </p>

    <h2>Accessibility</h2>
    <p>
        The interface uses semantic headings, keyboard-focus indicators, explicit labels, accessible status messages, responsive layouts,
        and text labels in addition to piece colors.
    </p>
</section>
